{
	"_help": "Weapon archetypes plus fictional manufacturers. Each roll picks a manufacturer allowed in the weapon's slot; its stat_mods are added to the rolled stats and one of its flavor lines is used (mythic-tier rolls use the archetype's mythic name, perk and flavor). Precision (head) hits multiply damage by the archetype's headshot_multiplier, falling back to headshot_multiplier_default. Optional per archetype: \"fire_sfx\" = sound key in assets/audio/sfx/weapons (file name minus _NN), \"burst\"/\"burst_interval\" = rounds per trigger pull and seconds between them (rpm stays the average fire rate).",
