		"_help": "Skillz (playtest batch, pulled forward from the weapons batch): which equip slot each archetype may sit in. GearDB.slot_for(archetype) / GearDB.slot_refusal(item, slot) read this; Inventory.equip_refusal (pickup, Hold-E take_and_equip, wheel cycle, stash equip) honours it, and saves with a weapon in the wrong slot are moved on load (Inventory.load_save_dict). primary = big guns (rifles, SMG, shotgun, LMG), secondary = handguns only (Sidearm; the Hand Cannon is the revolver, so it is a handgun), heavy = Sniper + Rocket Launcher (the launcher is neither big-gun primary nor handgun). An archetype's own `slot` field matches this map; `family` = its slot before the rule (keeps manufacturer and element rolls unchanged).",
